t"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because each property is found by its name, an event type can change while records written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before the change are still on disk. A property removed since leaves an entry the decoder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"skips, an optional property added since reads as ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", one with a default value reads it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/KeyedBinaryDecoder\/decode(_:forKey:default:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", and properties can be reordered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change the older bytes can’t satisfy, such as a required property added or a property’s type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changed, needs a new ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event.schemaVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the store drops records stored at another version","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without reading them, and reports them. One that throws from ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryCodable\/init(from:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" all the same is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped and reported too.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each value is one CBOR data item, so any CBOR decoder can read the bytes. Integers are CBOR","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integers in the fewest bytes that hold them, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":